// Title: OS Architecture Discovery Via Grep
// ID: d27ab432-2199-483f-a297-03633c05bae6
// Status: test
// Level: low
// Author: Joseliyo Sanchez, @Joseliyo_Jstnk
// Date: 2023-06-02
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1082
// Description: Detects the use of grep to identify information about the operating system architecture. Often combined beforehand with the execution of "uname" or "cat /proc/cpuinfo"
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((src.process.cmdline endswithCIS "aarch64" OR src.process.cmdline endswithCIS "arm" OR src.process.cmdline endswithCIS "i386" OR src.process.cmdline endswithCIS "i686" OR src.process.cmdline endswithCIS "mips" OR src.process.cmdline endswithCIS "x86_64")) AND (src.process.image.path endswithCIS "/grep"))
